      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you.\nThe `sysfs` interface was deprecated in Linux 4.8\nIs it guaranteed that the script is used only in Linux versions \u003e 4.8?\n\nIn addition, I did not find a `gpiod` API that allows to leave the gpio in a known state once the process is terminated.\n\nThank you",
